                                                "example_id": "e5e055d0-fc26-4519-8bd5-7116316416b8",
                                                "sense_id": "ae13b5d1-5071-3e36-a4bc-4f334affb7cc",
                                                "text": "[…] it appears the possibility of the ill-starred Uxbridge-Rickmansworth rail link being built is now bound up with post-war planning. [it was never built]"
                                            }
